---
// PreFooter.astro - Clean, Elegant Institutional CTA Banner
---
<section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 sm:py-14 font-sans" data-aos="fade-up">
  <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-[#092328] text-white p-8 sm:p-12 border border-[#12544F] shadow-lg">
    <!-- Subtle architectural dot pattern background -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10 pointer-events-none" style="background-image: radial-gradient(#8BBB92 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 24px 24px;"></div>

    <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between gap-8">
      <!-- Left Content -->
      <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-3">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-[#12544F] text-[#8BBB92] border border-[#2A835F]/40">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#8BBB92]"></span>
          <span>Penerimaan Siswa &amp; Santri Baru (PSB)</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight">
          Mari Bertumbuh Bersama <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
          <span class="text-[#8BBB92]">Yayasan Pesantren Sunan Kudus</span>
        </h2>

        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-normal pt-1">
          Wujudkan generasi beradab, berkarakter Qur'ani, dan unggul dalam sains teknologi bersama 6 jenjang pendidikan terpadu YP2SK.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Right CTA Buttons -->
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3 shrink-0">
        <a
          href="/kontak"
          class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#2A835F] hover:bg-[#12544F] text-white font-semibold text-xs sm:text-sm shadow-sm transition-all duration-200 text-center flex items-center justify-center gap-2 cursor-pointer"
        >
          <span>Daftar Sekarang</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">arrow_forward</span>
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://wa.me/6281234567890"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="px-5 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#12544F]/60 hover:bg-[#12544F] border border-[#8BBB92]/40 text-white font-medium text-xs sm:text-sm transition-all duration-200 text-center flex items-center justify-center gap-2 cursor-pointer"
        >
          <span>Chat WhatsApp</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">chat</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
